  "Helical entry": "",
  "Enters the first ring of the pocket in a spiral down instead of ramping along it or plunging: a smoother entry for an end mill that does not cut at its centre. It takes priority over Ramp in on that ring; Ramp in still applies to the rings inside it, and where the spiral does not fit": "",
  "Enters the cut in a spiral down on the waste side, next to the start of the path, instead of ramping along it or plunging. It takes priority over Ramp in (which is used where the spiral does not fit) and leaves a round hole in the waste about two tool diameters wide: lower the Circle size, or untick this and use Ramp in, if that material matters": "",
  "Clearing": "",
  "Rings": "",
  "Adaptive": "",
  "Trochoidal": "",
  "Rings from the wall inwards, a stepover apart": "",
  "A light stepover and the corners of the inner rings rounded, so the tool meets about the same amount of material all along the path. Gentler on the tool and the machine, and it can cut at full flute depth with a larger pass depth. More rings, so more moves": "",
  "The ring along the wall is cut as a string of small loops, so the tool is never buried in the full width of the slot. For narrow slots, hard material and small bits; the file has many short moves": "",
  "Step": "",
  "Slow down in tight corners": "",
  "Cuts at a lower feed just before and after a sharp corner, where the tool is buried deeper in the material than along a straight edge: less chatter, gentler on thin bits": "",
  "Lead-in / out": "",
  "Enters and leaves the cut along an arc on the waste side, so the tool does not plunge on the line or leave a mark where it stops": "",
  "Air run (pen 10 mm above the paper)": "",
  "Air cut (run without cutting)": "",
  "Runs this operation 10 mm above the stock (more for an operation deeper than 8 mm, so it never touches the stock) to check the movements": "",
  "Pause afterwards": "",
  "When this operation is done the tool lifts, the spindle stops and the program waits until you resume it: flip the stock, move a clamp, clear the chips.": "",
  "Message, e.g. Flip the stock": "",
